*.tmp
*.temp
*~

# ── Vendored offline Node deps (PptxGenJS presentation renderer) ──
# The presentation renderer must work on an air-gapped machine with no npm
# registry, so its full runtime dependency closure is committed. These negations
# come last so they win over the generic `node_modules/` and `dist/` rules above.
!presentation/node_modules/
!presentation/node_modules/**

# ── Hard Scenario 01: generated fixtures and benchmark output ───
# The fixtures are produced by tests/hard_scenario_01/build_fixtures.py and the
# run outputs by run_scenario.py; neither belongs in version control.
tests/fixtures/hard_scenario_01/
tests/hard_scenario_01/_golden/
bench/results/
